      "kind": "run",
      "start_seconds": 88.568,
      "end_seconds": 98.789,
      "narration_en": "Bash runs the script. It loads every ledger and writes both files. Work package A comes out as accepted, yet 10% of its payment is held back.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        204.0,
        206.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h11",
      "chapter": "AGENT",
      "kind": "notice",
      "start_seconds": 98.789,
      "end_seconds": 108.228,
      "narration_en": "The run succeeded, with no error. But after reading its own output, the model reports problems in the WP-A status logic and the sample filter.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        206.0,
        222.1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h12",
      "chapter": "AGENT",
      "kind": "edits",
      "start_seconds": 108.228,
      "end_seconds": 117.968,
      "narration_en": "It checks the scope: 81 people included, 2 observation-limited, 1 excluded. Then it reads the script, edits it four times, and runs it again.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        221.8,
        282.4
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h13",
      "chapter": "AGENT",
      "kind": "rerun",
      "start_seconds": 117.968,
      "end_seconds": 129.595,
      "narration_en": "Same script, still no error. This time WP-A is a conditional acceptance: 220,320 yuan to approve, 24,480 retained.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        282.2,
        283.5
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h14",
      "chapter": "AGENT",
      "kind": "verify",
      "start_seconds": 129.595,
      "end_seconds": 136.272,
      "narration_en": "It checks the nine-sheet workbook and the memo, and confirms that only the two required files are in the output folder.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        287.4,
        319.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h15",
      "chapter": "AGENT",
      "kind": "finish",
      "start_seconds": 136.272,
      "end_seconds": 145.086,
      "narration_en": "The plan is ticked off and the agent stops: 28 requests, 44 tool calls, about six minutes. Not one tool call failed.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        325.6,
        364.9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h16",
      "chapter": "HARNESS",
      "kind": "trace",
      "start_seconds": 145.536,
      "end_seconds": 157.252,
      "narration_en": "Here is the whole run. 33 Bash, 4 TodoWrite, 1 Write, 2 Read and 4 Edit calls. The turning point was not a crash; it came from the model reading its own results.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        364.9,
        364.9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h17",
      "chapter": "HARNESS",
      "kind": "context",
      "start_seconds": 157.252,
      "end_seconds": 166.769,
      "narration_en": "Each result is added to the model's context. By the last request, the prompt has grown from about 25 thousand to about 89 thousand tokens.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        364.9,
        364.9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h18",
      "chapter": "HARNESS",
      "kind": "handoff",
      "start_seconds": 166.769,
      "end_seconds": 173.518,
      "narration_en": "When the agent stops, Harbor copies the tests into the same container. Only then does scoring begin.",
      "trace_seconds": [
        364.9,
        364.9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h19",
      "chapter": "CHECK",
      "kind": "chapter",
      "start_seconds": 173.968,
      "end_seconds": 176.806,
      "narration_en": "An independent check now takes over.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h20",
      "chapter": "CHECK",
      "kind": "judges",
      "start_seconds": 176.806,
      "end_seconds": 188.711,
      "narration_en": "RewardKit opens one judge session for each of 34 criteria. The judge model is qwen3.7-plus, a different model from the agent. Nothing flows back to the agent.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h21",
      "chapter": "CHECK",
      "kind": "wpa",
      "start_seconds": 188.711,
      "end_seconds": 194.049,
      "narration_en": "The WP-A fix holds up: the judge accepts the conditional-acceptance status.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h22",
      "chapter": "CHECK",
      "kind": "pooled",
      "start_seconds": 194.049,
      "end_seconds": 203.03,
      "narration_en": "Other parts fall short. The workbook pools the three trained sites instead of comparing each one with the delayed site, and it has no source-index sheet.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h23",
      "chapter": "CHECK",
      "kind": "r32",
      "start_seconds": 203.03,
      "end_seconds": 211.398,
      "narration_en": "And one penalty applies. Ten people had too few chances to show the behavior, yet the workbook marks them as not meeting the standard.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h23b",
      "chapter": "CHECK",
      "kind": "r32",
      "start_seconds": 211.398,
      "end_seconds": 217.059,
      "narration_en": "Too little opportunity is not evidence of low ability, so seven weighted points are deducted.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h24",
      "chapter": "RESULT",
      "kind": "tally",
      "start_seconds": 217.509,
      "end_seconds": 227.004,
      "narration_en": "Of 28 positive criteria, 6 are met and 22 are not. One of six penalties applies, and this task has no red-line criteria.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h25",
      "chapter": "RESULT",
      "kind": "reward",
      "start_seconds": 227.004,
      "end_seconds": 237.481,
      "narration_en": "The recorded reward is 0.208: 29 points, minus 7, over 106. One pilot run on a fictional task, not a ranking.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h26",
      "chapter": "RESULT",
      "kind": "outro",
      "start_seconds": 237.481,
      "end_seconds": 244.733,
      "narration_en": "A professional task, an agent run, and an independent check. Explore more on the Metacase Challenge site.",
      "trace_seconds": null
    }
  ],
